*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: campaign folders under campaigns/ are intentionally NOT ignored —
# a campaign folder IS the save file and must be committed to survive the
# ephemeral environment. Only the live mechanical scratch is transient, but
# it is small and safe to commit too, so it is left tracked.
